  partName: Gasket (3)
  description: The Gasket (3) is a tiny, thin-flat component made of Material.001,
    positioned at the middle-center-center of the engine, playing a crucial role
    in sealing and preventing fluid leaks between engine components. Its small size
    belies its importance, as it helps maintain engine performance and efficiency.
    Interestingly, the Gasket (3) is often designed with a specific texture to ensure
    a secure seal.
